# An opinion paragraph in Russian: во-первых, также, таким образом
subtitle: "Я считаю, во-первых, также, однако, таким образом: build a Russian opinion paragraph in five steps, as Tom writes about the street by the museum."
tags: ["russian","russian writing","opinion paragraph","таким образом","trki exam"]
teaches: ["writing/essays","phrases/opinions","grammar/linking-words"]
thumb: "band \"Write your opinion in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Museum labels in Russian: хранимый, изучаемый, любимый","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/175-russian-museum-labels.cast"}

